      "level": 1,
      "topic": "daily life",
      "title_zh": "奶去哪儿了？",
      "title_en": "Where's the milk?",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["今天", "早上", "，", "我", "想", "喝", "奶", "。", "我", "在", "家里", "找", "了", "很", "多", "地方", "，", "都", "没有", "找到", "！"],
        ["妈妈", "问", "：", "“", "你", "在", "干什么", "？", "”"],
        ["我", "说", "：", "“", "没有", "了", "。", "是不是", "你", "喝", "了", "？", "”"],
        ["妈妈", "笑", "了", "：", "“", "不", "是", "我", "，", "是", "你", "爸爸", "！", "”"],
        ["爸爸", "说", "：", "“", "对不起", "！", "我", "马上", "去", "买", "。", "”", "他", "马上", "出去", "了", "。", "妈妈", "和", "我", "都", "笑", "了", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "This morning I wanted some milk. I looked all over the house but couldn’t find any!",
        "Mum asked: “What are you doing?”",
        "I said: “It’s all gone. Did you drink it?”",
        "Mum laughed: “It wasn’t me — it was your dad!”",
        "Dad said: “Sorry! I’ll go and buy some right now.” And off he went. Mum and I both laughed."
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["奶", "干什么", "是不是"],
      "glossary": [
