          "partner_en": "You really like football, don't you?",
          "prompt_en": "Say yes, you love it.",
          "answers_zh": ["是的，我非常喜欢。", "对，我很喜欢足球。"],
          "answers_en": ["Yes, I love it.", "Yes, I really like football."]
